[ULI][RESEARCH]Penetrating Scanners[/RESEARCH][/ULI]
[ULI][RESEARCH]Improved Sensors[/RESEARCH][/ULI]</Description>
				<Id1>-1</Id1> <!-- Receiving Race Id (-1=Triggering Empire, 256=Player) -->
